WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:15,130
Ants actually feed third-grade meat worms

2
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,130
Xu Shi Xu Shi

3
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,790
I can't get any benefits from fighting head-on.

4
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:22,790
If they had the same structure as the ants in my previous life

5
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,590
That being famous is their weakness

6
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:34,920
If they cut off their fame, they will be blind.

7
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:40,860
Not even anxious anymore

8
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:47,020
With this kind of strength, one bite would be enough to make you lose weight.

9
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,620
Don't sleep. There's something good over there.

10
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,820
Go, follow me
